From 042604110a3e406c51e5751430d7e86342b15701 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hiper25 <whydonit@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 15:28:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] media: meson: Add native SC2 codec engines and field-rate DI

Extend native SC2 decoding with the stateful VDEC engine, VP9 and AVS2,
and a field-rate post-engine spatial interpolator. Serialize shared DOS
access and preserve firmware, DMA and exported-surface lifetimes across
stream changes, drains, aborts and file teardown.

Use the existing original secure firmware loading contract; do not load
normal-world replacement microcode or weaken the storage RPC boundary.

The complete LibreELEC 6.18.57 package builds with the native Request,
stateful and DI modules enabled. Hardware qualification is separate.

Change-Id: I93ba09e5ca59831670bdbec2d837de514808d67a
---
